2.98c-.966 0-1.756.77-1.756 1.713v10.277c0 .942.79 1.712 1.756 1.712h14.04c.966 0 1.756-.77 1.756-1.712V4.862z"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="listuser-photo__credit">Spencer Brown</div></div><div class="listuser-image-container"><img src="https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/5f4526a6f048a75b8e14e6b2/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&amp;crop=3235,3234,x0,y381,safe&amp;height=416&amp;width=416&amp;fit=bounds" alt="profile image for Eric Schmidt" aria-label="Profile Image" tabindex="0"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="listuser-body listuser-spacing"><div class="listuser-content"><div class="listuser-alternative-bio__container"><div class="listuser-alternative-bio__header-wrapper"><div class="listuser-alternative-bio__header"><div class="listuser-alternative-bio__header--icon"><svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--profile-bug" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xml:space="preserve"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.8 1.8v16.3h16.3V1.8H1.8zm11.8 6.5C13.2 6.7 12.4 6 11.2 6H9.7c-.1.8-.1 2.2-.1 4.1h1.1c.6 0 1-.5 1.2-1.4h.4v3.5h-.4c-.2-.9-.6-1.4-1.2-1.4H9.6c0 1.1 0 2.1.1 2.9 0 .5.1.8.3 1 .1.2.4.3.7.4l.6.1v.4H5.9V15h.5c.3-.1.5-.2.7-.4s.2-.5.3-1c.2-2 .2-4.1 0-6.4 0-.5-.1-.8-.3-1s-.4-.4-.7-.5h-.5v-.5H14l.1 2.9-.5.2z"/></svg></div><div class="listuser-alternative-bio__header--title">From the Editor</div></div><h2 class="listuser-alternative-bio__header--date">Last Updated Mar 10, 2026, 1:01am EDT</h2></div><ul class="listuser-content__bio--content"><li>Eric Schmidt left the board of Google parent company Alphabet in June 2019 after 18 years; he stayed on as a technical advisor until February 2020.</li><li>Schmidt was Google's CEO from 2001 to 2011; prior to that he had stints as CEO of Novell and chief technology officer at Sun Microsystems.</li><li>He co-founded Innovation Endeavors, a venture capital firm that has invested in Uber, SoFi, and Zymergen, among others.</li><li>In May 2015, his family's investment vehicle bought a 20% stake in hedge fund firm D.E. Shaw &amp; Co. for an undisclosed price.</li></ul></div><div class="listuser-content__block person-networth-graph"><div class="person-networth-graph__content"><div class="person-networth-graph__title">Wealth History</div><div class="person-networth-graph__subtitle">HOVER TO REVEAL NET WORTH BY YEAR</div><canvas class="person-networth-chart" data-chart="[{&quot;percent&quot;:31.26760563380282,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$11.1B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;March 2017&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:37.74647887323944,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$13.4B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;March 2018&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:36.33802816901409,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$12.9B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;March 2019&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:37.183098591549296,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$13.2B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;April 2020&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:53.239436619718305,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$18.9B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;April 2021&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:62.25352112676056,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$22.1B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;April 2022&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:45.63380281690141,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$16.2B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;April 2023&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:58.028169014084504,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$20.6B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;April 2024&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:67.6056338028169,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$24B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;April 2025&quot;},{&quot;percent&quot;:100,&quot;worth&quot;:&quot;$35.5B&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Billionaires&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;March 2026&quot;}]"></canvas></div></div><div class="listuser-content__block ranking"><h2 class="listuser-block__title">Forbes Lists</h2><div class="ranking-metrics-summary"><div class="ranking-metrics-summary__cards"><div class="ranking-metric-card"><p class="metric-card__label">list appearances</p><p class="metric-card__value">36</p></div></div><div id="ranking-dropdown"></div></div><div id="ranking-sort-block"></div></div><div class="listuser-content__block person-stats"><h2 class="listuser-block__title">Personal Stats</h2><dl class="listuser-block"><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title">Age</dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">71</span></dd></dl><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title">Source of Wealth</dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">Google, Self Made</span></dd></dl><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title"><a href='https://www.forbes.com/self-made-methodology/' data-profile-ga-track='self made score-personal stats-Eric Schmidt'>Self-Made Score</a></dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">6</span></dd></dl><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title"><a href='https://www.forbes.com/philanthropy-methodology/' data-profile-ga-track='philanthropy score-personal stats-Eric Schmidt'>Philanthropy Score</a></dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">3</span></dd></dl><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title">Residence</dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">Atherton, California</span></dd></dl><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title">Citizenship</dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">United States</span></dd></dl><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title">Marital Status</dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">Married</span></dd></dl><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title">Children</dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">2</span></dd></dl><dl class="listuser-block__item"><dt class="profile-stats__title">Education</dt><dd class="profile-stats__text"><span class="profile-stats__text">Bachelor of Arts/Science, Princeton University; Doctorate, University of California, Berkeley; Master of Science, University of California, Berkeley</span></dd></dl></dl></div><div class="listuser-content__block profile-facts"><div class="listuser-block__title">Did you know</div><div class="profile-facts__slider"><div>Schmidt's family is passionate about environmental sustainability and has donated to various projects related to renewable energy and climate change.</div><div>He has toured some of the world's most tightly controlled regimes to promote open internet access, including in Cuba and North Korea.</div></div><div class="fbs-carousel__dots facts"><button class="dots active" aria-label="navigation 1" data-profile-ga-track="nav dots-fun facts- fact 1-Eric Schmidt"></button><button class="dots" aria-label="navigation 2" data-profile-ga-track="nav dots-fun facts- fact 2-Eric Schmidt"></button></div></div><div class="listuser-content__block profile-blockquote"><div class="listuser-block__title">In Their Own Words</div><blockquote><p>If you focus on your competition, you will never deliver anything truly innovative.</p><cite>Eric Schmidt</cite></blockquote></div><div class="listuser-content__block connections" data-expanded><div class="listuser-block__title">Related People &amp; Companies</div><div class="connection__wrapper"><a class="connection__image-link" href="/profile/alice-zhang/" aria-label="Alice Zhang"><img class="connection__image" src="https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/585845d04bbe6f1f20e94c0b/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&amp;crop=509,509,x68,y16,safe&amp;height=87&amp;width=87" alt="Alice Zhang"></a><div class="connec