" xml:space="preserve"><path d="M12.6 6.4l4.6 4.6H3v2h14.2l-4.6 4.6L14 19l7-7-7-7z"/></svg></a></div><div class="connection__wrapper"><a class="connection__image-link" href="/profile/rachel-zietz/" aria-label="Rachel Zietz"><img class="connection__image" src="https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/5ddc274c2dd2620006b951de/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&amp;crop=2172,2171,x1777,y493,safe&amp;height=87&amp;width=87" alt="Rachel Zietz"></a><div class="connection__info"><a class="connection__name" href="/profile/rachel-zietz/" aria-label="Rachel Zietz">Rachel Zietz</a><div class="connection__relationship-type">Related by education: Princeton University</div></div><a class="connection__link" href="/profile/rachel-zietz/" aria-label="View Rachel Zietz Profile" data-profile-ga-track="view profile-related-profile /profile/rachel-zietz/-Eric Schmidt">View Profile<svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--arrow-right" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xml:space="preserve"><path d="M12.6 6.4l4.6 4.6H3v2h14.2l-4.6 4.6L14 19l7-7-7-7z"/></svg></a></div><div class="connection__wrapper"><a class="connection__image-link" href="/profile/vivian-wang/" aria-label="Vivian Wang"><img class="connection__image" src="https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/6373063b39195562e8a8fb88/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&amp;crop=758,758,x306,y73,safe&amp;height=87&amp;width=87" alt="Vivian Wang"></a><div class="connection__info"><a class="connection__name" href="/profile/vivian-wang/" aria-label="Vivian Wang">Vivian Wang</a><div class="connection__relationship-type">Related by education: Princeton University</div></div><a class="connection__link" href="/profile/vivian-wang/" aria-label="View Vivian Wang Profile" data-profile-ga-track="view profile-related-profile /profile/vivian-wang/-Eric Schmidt">View Profile<svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--arrow-right" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xml:space="preserve"><path d="M