h14.04c.966 0 1.756-.77 1.756-1.712V4.862z"/></svg></a><a class="social-share__icon search-hidden-icon search-hidden-star"><div class="star-img"></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stream-item__fallback-image"><a class="stream-item__image ratio16x9" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/656627d702e1faa52c81b571/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&amp;crop=5552,3125,x4,y5,safe&amp;width=440&quot;)" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/tylerroush/2023/11/28/ex-google-ceo-warns-current-ai-guardrails-arent-enough-likened-development-to-nuclear-weapons/" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Ex-Google CEO Warns Current AI Guardrails ‘Aren’t Enough’—Likened Development To Nuclear Weapons" aria-label="Graphic Ex-Google CEO Warns Current AI Guardrails ‘Aren’t Enough’—Likened Development To Nuclear Weapons"></a></div></article><article class="stream-item et-promoblock-removeable-item et-promoblock-star-item" data-date="1700182636851" data-id="6556bb1591dfb92e4fdebca1" data-et-id="video/brightcove/6341247489112"><div class="stream-item__text"><div class="stream-item__date" data-date="1700182636851">Nov 16, 2023</div><a class="stream-item__title" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Inside Former Google CEO Eric Schmidt's $1 Billion Philanthropic Troubles" href="https://www.forbes.com/video/6341247489112/" aria-label="Click to watch video Inside Former Google CEO Eric Schmidt's $1 Billion Philanthropic Troubles"><h3>Inside Former Google CEO Eric Schmidt's $1 Billion Philanthropic Troubles</h3></a><div class="stream-item__description">David Jeans, a technology reporter for Forbes, joins 'Forbes Talks' to discuss the philanthropic troubles of former Google CEO, Eric Schmidt.</div><div><div class="stream-item__byline-social-wrapper"><span class="byline"><div class="byline__author-group"></div></span><div class="social-share"><span class="social-share__arrow"><svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--share" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/200