.jpg?format=jpg&amp;width=440&quot;)" href="https://www.forbes.com/video/6340439744112/" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Former Google CEO Launched A $100 Million Company With His Girlfriend. It's Not Going Well" aria-label="Graphic Former Google CEO Launched A $100 Million Company With His Girlfriend. It's Not Going Well"><div class="card__icon card__icon--preview">WATCH<svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--play-circle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 60 60" xml:space="preserve"><path class="fs-icon fs-icon--play" fill="#010101" d="M24.252 41.721V18.037l15.789 11.842z"/><path class="fs-icon fs-icon--circle" fill="#010101" d="M30 59.879c-16.542 0-30-13.457-30-30 0-16.542 13.458-30 30-30 16.543 0 30 13.458 30 30 0 16.543-13.457 30-30 30zm0-57.5c-15.164 0-27.5 12.336-27.5 27.5s12.336 27.5 27.5 27.5 27.5-12.336 27.5-27.5-12.336-27.5-27.5-27.5z"/></svg></div></a></div></article><article class="stream-item et-promoblock-removeable-item et-promoblock-star-item" data-date="1698057000000" data-id="6526bd14e6ccfe3fc2f50cf2" data-et-id="blogAndPostId/blog/post/50171-6526bd14e6ccfe3fc2f50cf2"><div class="stream-item__text"><div class="stream-item__date" data-date="1698057000000">Oct 23, 2023</div><a class="stream-item__title" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Former Google CEO Launched A $100 Million Company With His Girlfriend. It’s Not Going Well" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/davidjeans/2023/10/23/eric-schmidt-michelle-ritter-steel-perlot/"><h3>Former Google CEO Launched A $100 Million Company With His Girlfriend. It’s Not Going Well</h3></a><div class="stream-item__description">Married billionaire Eric Schmidt launched a startup with 29-year-old entrepreneur Michelle Ritter while they were dating, blurring his professional and personal life.</div><div><div class="stream-item__byline-social-wrapper"><span class="byline"><div class="byline__author-group"><div class="byline__author"><span class="byline__by">By</span><a class="byline