llion Company With His Girlfriend. It’s Not Going Well" aria-label="Graphic Former Google CEO Launched A $100 Million Company With His Girlfriend. It’s Not Going Well"></a></div></article><article class="stream-item et-promoblock-removeable-item et-promoblock-star-item" data-date="1692188199484" data-id="64dc809c68458b1e11fe0dcf" data-et-id="blogAndPostId/blog/post/50342-64dc809c68458b1e11fe0dcf"><div class="stream-item__text"><div class="stream-item__date" data-date="1692188199484">Aug 16, 2023</div><a class="stream-item__title" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Could Small Drones Really Replace Artillery?" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/davidhambling/2023/08/16/could-small-drones-really-replace-artillery/"><h3>Could Small Drones Really Replace Artillery?</h3></a><div class="stream-item__description">Former Google boss Eric Schmidt has suggested small drones could replace artillery and other weapons. Techno-enthusiasm is one thing, but could he possibly be right?</div><div><div class="stream-item__byline-social-wrapper"><span class="byline"><div class="byline__author-group"><div class="byline__author"><span class="byline__by">By</span><a class="byline__author-name" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - David Hambling" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/davidhambling/">David Hambling</a><span class="byline__author-type">Senior Contributor</span></div></div></span><div class="social-share"><span class="social-share__arrow"><svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--share" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xml:space="preserve"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18 16.1c-.8 0-1.4.3-2 .8l-7.1-4.2c.1-.2.1-.5.1-.7s0-.5-.1-.7L16 7.2c.5.5 1.2.8 2 .8 1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3s-1.3-3-3-3-3 1.3-3 3c0 .2 0 .5.1.7L8 9.8C7.5 9.3 6.8 9 6 9c-1.7 0-3 1.3-3 3s1.3 3 3 3c.8 0 1.5-.3 2-.8l7.1 4.2c-.1.2-.1.4-.1.6 0 1.6 1.3 2.9 2.9 2.9s2.9-1.3 2.9-2.9-1.2-2.9-2.8-2.9z"/></svg></span><div class="social-share__icon-wrapper"><a class="social-share__i