r-chatbot-pi%2F%0A%0AInflection%20AI%2C%20The%20Year-Old%20Startup%20Behind%20Chatbot%20Pi%2C%20Raises%20%241.3%20Billion%0A" aria-label="Share Email" data-ga-track="Email Click"><svg stroke-miterlimit="10" class="fs-icon fs-icon--email" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xml:space="preserve" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="nonzero" clip-rule="evenodd" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.021 15.139H2.98V6.574L10 10.856l7.021-4.282v8.565zm0-10.277L10 9.144 2.979 4.862H17.02zm1.756 0c0-.943-.79-1.713-1.756-1.713H2.98c-.966 0-1.756.77-1.756 1.713v10.277c0 .942.79 1.712 1.756 1.712h14.04c.966 0 1.756-.77 1.756-1.712V4.862z"/></svg></a><a class="social-share__icon search-hidden-icon search-hidden-star"><div class="star-img"></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stream-item__fallback-image"><a class="stream-item__image ratio16x9" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/649cb5675d119f2ba96aa415/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&amp;crop=1920,1080,x0,y0,safe&amp;width=440&quot;)" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/alexkonrad/2023/06/29/inflection-ai-raises-1-billion-for-chatbot-pi/" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Inflection AI, The Year-Old Startup Behind Chatbot Pi, Raises $1.3 Billion" aria-label="Graphic Inflection AI, The Year-Old Startup Behind Chatbot Pi, Raises $1.3 Billion"></a></div></article><article class="stream-item et-promoblock-removeable-item et-promoblock-star-item" data-date="1687811227626" data-id="6499f54cb3c86557b6d7a276" data-et-id="video/brightcove/6330144835112"><div class="stream-item__text"><div class="stream-item__date" data-date="1687811227626">Jun 26, 2023</div><a class="stream-item__title" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - AI Will Make 2024 Election A ‘Mess,’ Billionaire Ex-Google Chief Schmidt Says" href="https://www.forbes.com/video/6330144835112/" aria-label="Click to watch video AI Will Make 2024 Election A ‘Mess,’ Billionaire Ex-Google Chief Schmidt Says"><h3>AI Will Make 2024 Election A ‘Mess,’ Billionaire Ex-Google Chief Schmidt Says</h3></a><div class="stream-item__description">Eric Schmidt, the former CEO of Google parent Alphabet, warned Monday that generative artificial intelligence will throw a wrench into upcoming elections.</div><div><div class="stream-item__byline-social-wrapper"><span class="byline"><div class="byline__author-group"></div></span><div class="social-share"><span class="social-share__arrow"><svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--share" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xml:space="preserve"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18 16.1c-.8 0-1.4.3-2 .8l-7.1-4.2c.1-.2.1-.5.1-.7s0-.5-.1-.7L16 7.2c.5.5 1.2.8 2 .8 1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3s-1.3-3-3-3-3 1.3-3 3c0 .2 0 .5.1.7L8 9.8C7.5 9.3 6.8 9 6 9c-1.7 0-3 1.3-3 3s1.3 3 3 3c.8 0 1.5-.3 2-.8l7.1 4.2c-.1.2-.1.4-.1.6 0 1.6 1.3 2.9 2.9 2.9s2.9-1.3 2.9-2.9-1.2-2.9-2.8-2.9z"/></svg></span><div class="social-share__icon-wrapper"><a class="social-share__icon social-share__icon--facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/dialog/feed?app_id=123694841080850&amp;link=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.forbes.com%2Fvideo%2F6330144835112%2F&amp;picture=https%3A%2F%2Fimageio.forbes.com%2Fi-forbesimg%2Fmedia%2Fvideo%2F2023%2F06%2F26%2F6330144835112_still.jpg%3Fformat%3Djpg%26width%3D440&amp;name=AI%20Will%20Make%202024%20Election%20A%20%E2%80%98Mess%2C%E2%80%99%20Billionaire%20Ex-Google%20Chief%20Schmidt%20Says&amp;caption=www.forbes.com&amp;description=Eric%20Schmidt%2C%20the%20former%20CEO%20of%20Google%20parent%20Alphabet%2C%20warned%20Monday%20that%20generative%20artificial%20intelligence%20will%20throw%20a%20wrench%20into%20upcoming%20elections." rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-src="Facebook" aria-label="Share Facebook" data-ga-track="Facebook Click"><svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--Facebook" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xml:space="preserve" transform="scale(.9)"><path fill-rule="eve