</div><div><div class="stream-item__byline-social-wrapper"><span class="byline"><div class="byline__author-group"><div class="byline__author"><span class="byline__by">By</span><a class="byline__author-name" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Derek Saul" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/dereksaul/">Derek Saul</a><span class="byline__author-type">Former Staff</span></div></div></span><div class="social-share"><span class="social-share__arrow"><svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--share" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xml:space="preserve"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M18 16.1c-.8 0-1.4.3-2 .8l-7.1-4.2c.1-.2.1-.5.1-.7s0-.5-.1-.7L16 7.2c.5.5 1.2.8 2 .8 1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3s-1.3-3-3-3-3 1.3-3 3c0 .2 0 .5.1.7L8 9.8C7.5 9.3 6.8 9 6 9c-1.7 0-3 1.3-3 3s1.3 3 3 3c.8 0 1.5-.3 2-.8l7.1 4.2c-.1.2-.1.4-.1.6 0 1.6 1.3 2.9 2.9 2.9s2.9-1.3 2.9-2.9-1.2-2.9-2.8-2.9z"/></svg></span><div class="social-share__icon-wrapper"><a class="social-share__icon social-share__icon--facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/dialog/feed?app_id=123694841080850&amp;link=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.forbes.com%2Fsites%2Fdereksaul%2F2023%2F06%2F26%2Fai-will-make-2024-election-a-mess-billionaire-ex-google-chief-schmidt-says%2F&amp;picture=https%3A%2F%2Fimageio.forbes.com%2Fspecials-images%2Fimageserve%2F6499ad61072e79e0d062d65b%2F0x0.jpg%3Fformat%3Djpg%26crop%3D4000%2C2252%2Cx0%2Cy206%2Csafe%26width%3D440&amp;name=AI%20Will%20Make%202024%20Election%20A%20%E2%80%98Mess%2C%E2%80%99%20Billionaire%20Ex-Google%20Chief%20Schmidt%20Says&amp;caption=www.forbes.com&amp;description=Social%20media%20is%20not%20%E2%80%9Cprotecting%20us%20from%20false%20generative%20AI%2C%E2%80%9D%20Eric%20Schmidt%20said%20Monday.%20%20%20%20%20%20%0A" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-src="Facebook" aria-label="Share Facebook" data-ga-track="Facebook Click"><svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--Facebook" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" 