.713-1.756-1.713H2.98c-.966 0-1.756.77-1.756 1.713v10.277c0 .942.79 1.712 1.756 1.712h14.04c.966 0 1.756-.77 1.756-1.712V4.862z"/></svg></a><a class="social-share__icon search-hidden-icon search-hidden-star"><div class="star-img"></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stream-item__fallback-image"><a class="stream-item__image ratio16x9" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/646e2c501dfd9a2eb25f411d/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&amp;crop=3958,2226,x0,y98,safe&amp;width=440&quot;)" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/tylerroush/2023/05/24/former-google-ceo-warns-ai-could-cause-people-to-be-harmed-or-killed/" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Former Google CEO Warns AI Could Cause People To Be ‘Harmed Or Killed’" aria-label="Graphic Former Google CEO Warns AI Could Cause People To Be ‘Harmed Or Killed’"></a></div></article><article class="stream-item et-promoblock-removeable-item et-promoblock-star-item" data-date="1684008078577" data-id="645febd5e93c063c3af9c356" data-et-id="blogAndPostId/blog/post/7321-645febd5e93c063c3af9c356"><div class="stream-item__text"><div class="stream-item__date" data-date="1684008078577">May 13, 2023</div><a class="stream-item__title" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Why Former Google CEO Eric Schmidt Is Betting Big On The $1T US Bioeconomy" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/johncumbers/2023/05/13/why-former-google-ceo-eric-schmidt-is-betting-big-on-the-1t-us-bioeconomy/"><h3>Why Former Google CEO Eric Schmidt Is Betting Big On The $1T US Bioeconomy</h3></a><div class="stream-item__description">After being at the helm for over a decade of internet juggernaut Google, former CEO Eric Schmidt has switched gears and one of his latest activities is being an advocate for the fast-growing US bioeconomy, which is valued at over $1T.</div><div><div class="stream-item__byline-social-wrapper"><span class="byline"><div class="byline__author-group"><div class="byline__author"><span class="byline__