%20%24148%20million%20to%20fund%20the%20Eric%20and%20Wendy%20Schmidt%20AI%20in%20Science%20Postdoctoral%20Fellowship.%20Co-founded%20by%20former%20Google%20CEO%2FChairman%20Eric%20Schmidt%20and%20his%20wife%20Wendy%2C%20Schmidt%20Futures%20has%20now%20provided%20%24400%20million%20for%20the%20use%20of%20artificial%20intelligence%20in%20scientific%20research.%20" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-src="LinkedIn" aria-label="Share Linkedin" data-ga-track="LinkedIn Click"><svg version="1.1" class="fs-icon fs-icon--linkedin" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xml:space="preserve"><path d="M7.6 20H4.4V9.4h3.4V20h-.2zM6 8c-1 0-2-.8-2-2s.8-2 2-2c1 0 2 .8 2 2S7 8 6 8zm14 12h-3.2v-5.6c0-1.6-.602-2.4-1.801-2.4-1.4 0-2 .8-2 2.4V20h-3.2V9.4h3.2v1.4s1-1.8 3.2-1.8 3.8 1.4 3.8 4.2V20z"/></svg></a><a class="desktop email social-share__icon social-share__icon--email" href="mailto:?subject=Schmidt%20Futures%20Will%20Invest%20Additional%20%24148%20Million%20In%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Research&amp;body=Hi%2C%0A%0AI%20thought%20you'd%20like%20this%3A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.forbes.com%2Fsites%2Fmichaeltnietzel%2F2022%2F10%2F26%2Fschmidt-futures-will-invest-additional-148-million-in-artificial-intelligence-research%2F%0A%0ASchmidt%20Futures%20Will%20Invest%20Additional%20%24148%20Million%20In%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20Research%0A" aria-label="Share Email" data-ga-track="Email Click"><svg stroke-miterlimit="10" class="fs-icon fs-icon--email" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xml:space="preserve" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="nonzero" clip-rule="evenodd" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.021 15.139H2.98V6.574L10 10.856l7.021-4.282v8.565zm0-10.277L10 9.144 2.979 4.862H17.02zm1.756 0c0-.943-.79-1.713-1.756-1.713H2.98c-.966 0-1.756.77-1.756 1.713v10.277c0 .942.79 1.712 1.756 1.712h14.04c.966 0 1.756-.77 1.756-1.712V4.862z"/></svg></a><a class="social-share__icon search-hidden-icon search-hidden-star"><div class="star-img"></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stream-item__fallback-image"><a class="stream-item__image ratio16x9" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/6356dda007b48e7556b358e1/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&amp;width=440&quot;)" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/michaeltnietzel/2022/10/26/schmidt-futures-will-invest-additional-148-million-in-artificial-intelligence-research/" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - Schmidt Futures Will Invest Additional $148 Million In Artificial Intelligence Research" aria-label="Graphic Schmidt Futures Will Invest Additional $148 Million In Artificial Intelligence Research"></a></div></article><article class="stream-item et-promoblock-removeable-item et-promoblock-star-item" data-date="1664624744000" data-id="6336b0cce39b5800016d1f50" data-et-id="blogAndPostId/blog/post/5660-6336b0cce39b5800016d1f50"><div class="stream-item__text"><div class="stream-item__date" data-date="1664624744000">Oct 1, 2022</div><a class="stream-item__title" data-ga-track="undefined - Stream - ‘Better Tech’—A Legendary Google Billionaire Is Backing A Radical Bitcoin And Ethereum Rival Despite Huge $2 Trillion Crypto Price Crash" href="https://www.forbes.com/sites/billybambrough/2022/10/01/better-tech-a-legendary-google-billionaire-is-backing-a-radical-bitcoin-and-ethereum-rival-despite-huge-2-trillion-crypto-price-crash/"><h3>‘Better Tech’—A Legendary Google Billionaire Is Backing A Radical Bitcoin And Ethereum Rival Despite Huge $2 Trillion Crypto Price Crash</h3></a><div class="stream-item__description">Former Google chief executive and billionaire Eric Schmidt has said chainlink has &quot;better technology&quot; and &quot;scales better&quot; than other cryptocurrencies like bitcoin and ethereum...</div><div><div class="stream-item__byline-social-wrapper"><span class="byline"><div class="byline__author-group"><div class="byline__author"><span class="byline__by">By</span><a class="byline__author-name" dat